    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "...M\u0142ynar?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Are you there? M\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "Aunt Zofia?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Oh... Margaret. Why are you still at home?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Didn't Maria say you were going to the Knights Association? That girl..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "It's rote procedure. It won't take much effort."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Heheh. You really have changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Is it thanks to that 'Rhodes Island' place? You never were any good with the paperwork side of things before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Do you still remember when you'd just applied to become a knight? Independent knight Margaret Nearl, always getting her documents and processes mixed up..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "Yes. I'm lucky I had you then, Auntie."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "*Sigh*... I understand it with Maria at least, but aren't you the same age as me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "I spent so much energy getting you to call me by name. We're apart a few years and now that's undone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "We can't have gotten strange from each other, can we? Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "Heheh, don't worry, Zofia. It's just been a long while since I've talked with family like this, face to face."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "Were you here looking for Uncle?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Yes. Is he still at work?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "Still not home anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "You know, M\u0142ynar..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "...I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "I'll be civil with him, and I won't blame him either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Margaret",
        "text": "So don't worry."
    },
