        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Oh... the match's about to start."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Same as it ever was. Turnout's ridiculous."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "That Blade Helmet Knightclub sap there, didn't he show up last year too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Here, forget him, even their Left-hand Knight fell to Maria. What's the Blade Helmet Knightclub got?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Ugh... it was just luck, all luck. It's always embarrassing when they blow things out of proportion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Oh. Seems like 'Brassrust' Olmer Ingra's in this match tonight too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Ha, well-acquainted, aren't you, Maria\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "\u2014Learn to shut your mouth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "It's alright, Master Kowal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "I've already given up on becoming a competition knight. It just doesn't suit me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "That's what I'm saying! You've got a wide world of options open to you\u2014no need to choose this or that! That's a bit of old-timer advice there!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Besides, you've made a mighty fine showing already! Cheers to you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Speaking of, we still haven't done final testing on Margaret's armor, have we?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Her last suit had some decent work on it, but it still doesn't fit a Kuranta as big and brave as Margaret."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Ah... I already started on adjustments myself. I'll need a bit more time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "And there's her weapon..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "When Margaret was new to the knight competitions, she used a warhammer. After that, she switched to a knight's longsword. Halos shone at her blade's edge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Now\u2014she's on a swordspear."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_101"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Hah! It's a Minoan beauty forged of D32 Steel. The ultimate in Originium Arts conductivity!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Really takes me back. She came knocking, asking if I could change her sword out for an easier one to handle\u2014the very first time Old Nearl's granddaughter ever asked a word of me\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Enough nostalgia, Kowal, the Radiant Knight's down in the arena next week. Are you people even helping her?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Repeat that? You think I'm anything like you? Nothing but drink and idle hands all day?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 0
        }
